  {
    "title_zh": "我也很漂亮",
    "title_en": "I'm Beautiful Too",
    "target_age": "4-7",
    "source_type": "pdf",
    "source_file": "我也很漂亮（4-7 岁）.pdf",
    "page_index_in_story": 3,
    "source_page": 3,
    "image_path": "images/slide_03.png",
    "page_text_ocr_zh": "给读者的话\n\n为什么粉色啦不如蓝色啦宁静？不如黄色啦明亮？不如红色啦鲜艳？因为蓝、黄、红三种颜色都很单纯，他们是“三原色”。\n\n粉色不像“三原色”那样单纯，把红和白掺和到一起，才形成了粉色。\n\n粉色有自己的特点，你看粉色啦为小朋友布置的房间、设计的太阳帽、发带和小礼物，多么美丽、柔和，多让人喜欢。\n\n粉色啦开始觉得不如大家，伤心、胆怯，后来，发挥了自己特长，就变得快乐、自信了。\n\n小朋友，你听，快乐、自信的小粉色啦在说什么呢？\n\n对！她在大声地说：“我也很漂亮！”",
    "page_text_en": "A Message to the Reader\n\nWhy is pink not as calm as blue? Not as bright as yellow? Not as vibrant as red? Because blue, yellow, and red are pure colors—the 'primary colors'.\n\nPink is not as pure as the 'primary colors'. It is formed by mixing red and white together.\n\nPink has its own characteristics. Look at the rooms pink has arranged for children, the sun hats, hairbands, and little gifts she has designed—how beautiful and gentle they are, how much they are loved.\n\nAt first, pink felt she was not as good as everyone else, feeling sad and timid. Later, by using her own strengths, she became happy and confident.\n\nChildren, listen—what is the happy, confident little pink saying?\n\nThat's right! She is shouting loudly: \"I am beautiful too!\"",
    "summary_zh": "本页是绘本《我也很漂亮》的‘给读者的话’，通过解释粉色的由来和特点，讲述粉色角色从自卑到自信的心路历程，鼓励孩子接纳自我、发现自身价值。"
  },
